  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="42.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 42.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne cirican geierne, sie ðonne be ðære cirican are, swa we ær bufan cwædon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he however makes it to a church [for sanctuary], let it be according to church privilege, as we spoke of before above.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he flees to a church, the privileges of the church shall be respected, as we have declared above.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne ciricean gyrne, sy ðonne be þære ciricean áre, swa we ær bufon cwædon.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
